# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Argus · 统一的 Git 忽略规则
#  三条底线：① 永不入库密钥  ② 永不入库运行期数据  ③ 永不入库构建产物
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ────────────────────────── 编辑器 / 操作系统 ──────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ────────────────────────── 密钥与本地凭据（最高优先级）──────────────────────────
# 终端绑定网关后自动生成的设备身份，含 token 与分配到的 Key
terminal/configs/remote.json
terminal/configs/remote.json.bak

# 网关数据库（含真实用户、供应商 Key、配额与审计数据）
gateway/data/
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# 证书 / 私钥 / 环境变量
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.local
**/openguard/original/.env
**/openguard/original/keys/
**/openguard/original/jwt_private.pem
**/openguard/original/jwt_public.pem

# 运行期数据目录
**/openguard/original/data/

# 仓库根运行期状态（隔离库、临时工作目录等；测试/联调时按需生成）
/runtime/

# ────────────────────────── 备份 / 临时文件 ──────────────────────────
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*.old
**/package-lock.json.local

# ────────────────────────── Python（terminal/）──────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/
env/

terminal/runtime/
terminal/runtime-logs/
terminal/**/*.log
terminal/_argus.*.log
terminal/openguard/original/*.log
terminal/openguard/original/runtime/

# 检索 / IO 守卫的模型权重体积大，按需本地下载
terminal/argus/modules/retrieval_guard/models/*
!terminal/argus/modules/retrieval_guard/models/.gitkeep
terminal/argus/modules/io_guard/original/models/
terminal/argus/modules/io_guard/original/model_heads/*/
# \u9636\u6bb5\u611f\u77e5\u5b57\u7b26\u5206\u7c7b\u5668\u6743\u91cd\uff1aio_guard README \u58f0\u660e\u201c\u5df2\u968f\u4ed3\u5e93\u63d0\u4ea4\uff0c\u53ef\u79bb\u7ebf\u52a0\u8f7d\u201d\uff0c\u6545\u9700\u5165\u5e93
!terminal/argus/modules/io_guard/original/model_heads/io-guard-stage-char-v3/
terminal/argus/modules/io_guard/original/runtime/
terminal/argus/modules/io_guard/original/work/

# ────────────────────────── Go（gateway/）──────────────────────────
gateway/bin/
gateway/.go/
gateway/*.exe
gateway/llmgate
gateway/llmgate-*

# ────────────────────────── Node / Electron ──────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.npm/

# 桌面端构建与打包产物
desktop/dist/
desktop/release/
desktop/release-nsis/
desktop/.stage/
desktop/runtime-logs/
desktop/.test-user-data*/

# 网关前端构建产物由 `npm run build` 生成后提交（内嵌进 Go 二进制），
# 因此 gateway/web/dist 不在此处忽略。

# ────────────────────────── 打包 / 分发产物 ──────────────────────────
*.exe
*.msi
*.dmg
*.AppImage
*.zip
/release/
/build-output/
